-- A9 adopts q/kdb+'s Greater and Lesser over the carriers Ano admits, and Ano admits char, so the char instances are a derivation and not a new glyph: | is the greater rune, & the lesser, and max/min bridge to them exactly as they do over numbers.
-- The order is the code-point order. It has no greatest or least rune, so an empty scope has no result row: the last query prints nothing rather than a code-point zero.
--! registry ../registries/142-glyph-extrema.reg

--! out sow
"sat" | "cow"

--! out cat
"sat" & "cow"

--! out n
max/ Rune

--! out e
min/ Rune

--! out n
|/ Rune

--! out e
&/ Rune

--! out ggnnn
|\ Rune

--! out geeee
&\ Rune

--! out ggnnn
max\ Rune

--! out geeee
min\ Rune

--! out 0 0 1 1 1
(|\ Rune) == (max/ Rune)

--! out i
max/ Rune @ Alive

--! out
max/ Rune @ Gone
